diagram class
notation Starr
presentation default
orientation landscape
color mint
sheet A1
padding l150 b50
frame Model Integration Diagram
frame_presentation default
nodes
    Pace Program 10,2
    Organ 10,4-5
    Region 10,7
    Activity 10,9-10
    Pace Timeout Period/2 12,9-10
    Pace Event 11,12
    Intrinsic Event 9,12
    Event 10,13-14
    Region Stimulation/2 7-8,9-10
    Region Schedule 6-7,4-5
    Task Timeline 4-5,4-5
    Task Window 4-5,7
    Timed Task Window/2 5,8-9
    Client Terminated Task Window/2 4,8-9
    Client Task 3,7
connectors
    -R1 : +/2 r|Organ : +/1 l*|Region
    -R2.2 : +/2 b|Region : +/2 b|Event, t|Region Stimulation : L8R+2
    -R3 : -/2 b|Pace Program : +/1 l|Region Stimulation, t|Region Schedule
    +R4 : -/2 b|Region Schedule : -/2 t*|Task Timeline
    -R5 : +/2 r|Task Timeline : +/2 l*|Task Window
    -R6 : +/1 r|Region : +/1 l*|Activity
    +R7 : r|Task Window { l|Timed Task Window, l|Client Terminated Task Window }
    -R8 : +/2 b|Activity : +/1 l|Intrinsic Event
    +R9 : +/2 t+2|Activity : -/1 l|Pace Event
    +R10 : l|Event { r|Intrinsic Event, r|Pace Event }
    +R12.2 : +/2 t|Pace Event : +/2 r|Pace Timeout Period
    +R13 : -/1 t-1|Activity : -/2 b*|Pace Timeout Period
    +R14 : +/1 l|Pace Timeout Period : -/2 t|Pace Program
    -R15 : +/2 l*|Organ : +/2 r|Pace Program
    +OR18.2-1 : -/1 t-1|Task Window : +/1 t+1|Task Window : L5R+1
    +R17 : -/1 b|Task Window : -/2 t*|Client Task